Cooked native review UI test fixture

Source: https://github.com/nextwork-projects/ai-video-editor-cooked/blob/bce911c1d0652f30b64fd5283cc4aa9fa92811c9/plugins/ai-editor/lib/ai_editor/review.html
Uncompressed SHA-256: bfdffe39feb7891e07d70a0b31240d1aaa46c9ac8ec3b3dc754625fa8b5685bf

This gzip is a byte-identical, deterministic test copy of the already pinned native document. It is served only by synthetic browser interception after the production HTML hash check. It adds no engine, renderer, model, provider, font, music or application dependency. Synthetic API responses do not prove transcription or rendering.

